people that are positive.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.100
The people you spend time with

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.530
are the ones that dictate your mindset.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:57.363
- Yeah.

00:01:57.363 --> 00:01:58.810
